onna go with mr ricky badman duran  um he and i struck up a friendship uh  early on in the show  and i had no idea how great of a guitar  player he was and towards the end we did  this like little  you know i don't know video thing or  whatever and he started playing guitar  and i said you're a bad man and ever  since then it stuck as bad man duran and  not long ago i released  a my version of la bamba and i had ricky  actually come sing on it and play guitar  on it  so if anybody is going to be on the team  it's got to be ricky  [Music]  the last spot on my roster the dream  team is somebody who i think could have  should or could have however you want to  say one at all and i'm gonna go with the  swann brothers  i remember the season that they were on  i was living in the dominican republic  with my family and i remember hearing  their music  on you on youtube watching it and going  oh my gosh these dudes are so good i  have since interviewed them once on like  a little show that i had done  but you know just the music that they  continue to put out and just those  harmonies that they've got and their  personalities  i easily think they could have won it  all great guys even better musicians i'm  gonna go with the swan brothers as my  last spot on the roster  all right y'all i'm about to sign off  that was my dream team  and you know let me know who you'd pick  on your dream team i'm hoping that i'm  making the list but if i'm not it's okay  i forgive you  but in the meantime y'all be sure to  tune in march 31st  to watch me and kelly sing our single  together i would have loved you on the  kelly clarkson show  yep i'm still here just waiting for you  to subscribe  if you don't i'll be trapped in this box  forever
 

